      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_316340e19253c50bf5816eb11c4726ac2ddcd33e537c8532aecc21ad059007aa"
      ],
      "text": "For Lean work the agent chooses among four atomic tools: LeanGoal (inspect a source position), LeanCheck (compile a file or candidate with structured feedback), LeanSearch (query one provider), and LeanVerify (strict final check; only data.verified=true certifies completion)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_16e7d6fb4507877f4412c1efd259fae7e97201c1e596d767ebc86b560698fb8b",
